OL,3,ABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has invited the
OL,8,FScottish government to work with the UK
OL,9,Fgovernment to put "power back in the
OL,10,Fhands" of regions.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham said he wanted the two
OL,13,Fgovernments to start work on a new deal
OL,14,Ffor regional economic development in
OL,15,Fthe next few months, including an offer
OL,16,Fof devolution from the Department for
OL,17,FWork and Pensions (DWP).
OL,19,FSpeaking at an event in North
OL,20,FLanarkshire, Burnham called for further
OL,21,Fpowers to be devolved from Holyrood to
OL,22,Flocal areas before that happened.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
