OL,3,ABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore Burnham's speech, Swinney said
OL,8,Fhe was interested in "working
OL,9,Fconstructively" with Westminster,
OL,10,Fadding he was "all for the Scottish
OL,11,FParliament having as many powers" as
OL,12,Fpossible.
